					"content": "這個老毛病啊，到底什麼時候能好呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600902,
						200600904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特納"
				},
				{
					"id": 200600902,
					"content": "這是藥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600903
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200600903,
					"content": "#好，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特納"
				},
				{
					"id": 200600907,
					"content": "慚愧啊，孩子在奮鬥，我卻什麼忙都幫不上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特納"
				},
				{
					"id": 200600908,
					"content": "唯一能做到的事，就是不給孩子添麻煩了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特納"
				},
				{
					"id": 200600909,
					"content": "哦，對了，這些給您，請您收下吧，這是老頭子我的一點謝禮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "特納"
				},
				{
					"id": 200600904,
					"content": "吉麗安娜建議靜養…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600905
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200600905,
					"content": "靜養的話，就必須讓蓋伊那臭小子回來了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特納"
				},
				{
					"id": 200600906,
					"content": "沒事，我這把老骨頭還不會散架。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200600907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特納"
				}
			]
